{
  "characters": [
    { "id": "role1", "name": "憂鬱生鱼片", "color": "#c8c8ff" },
    { "id": "role2", "name": "服务员", "color": "#c8c8ff" },
    { "id": "role3", "name": "杨辰", "color": "#c8c8ff" },
    { "id": "role4", "name": "大龙", "color": "#c8c8ff" },
    { "id": "role5", "name": "老吕", "color": "#c8c8ff" }
  ],
  "dialogues": [
    { "roleId": "role1", "text": "我不太明白为什么这种答辩半成品都有人要()" },
    { "roleId": "role1", "text": "既然如此,求求关注b站憂鬱生鱼片喵！关注b站憂鬱生鱼片谢谢喵！！（憂鬱是忧郁的繁体）" },
    { "roleId": "role1", "text": "b站小giao移植鸿蒙" },
    { "bgm": "audio/audio1.mp3" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "弗雷尔卓德的冬夜常是如此" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "天空像是块被搓灰的毛玻璃" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "钝刀子般的寒风呼啸不停,吹得我脸生疼" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "靴底踩碎地上零星的白霜,发出刺耳的\"嘎吱\"声" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "恐怕这就是这死寂冬夜里唯一的节奏" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "忽然,鼻尖触及一点冰凉" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "抬头望去,沉默的天幕撕开了口子,鹅毛大雪砸了下来" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "啊啊,又下雪了啊" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "正当我这样想着的时候,自己的身体已经开始止不住的颤抖" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "远处有一道光......" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "那是一家......饭店吗" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "我向老吕使了个眼色,我们加快了脚步" },
    { "background": "images/bg2.jpg" },
    { "bgm": "audio/audio2.mp3" },
    { "roleId": "role2", "text": "里面请,哥", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202715_366_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "来点什么？", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202715_366_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "roleId": "role3", "text": "我看看菜单哈", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202715_366_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "老实说,我不是很饿", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202715_366_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "但是我实在是受不了外边的严寒了", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202715_366_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "或许是我年龄大了吧", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202715_366_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "这么想的时候,我注意到服务员还站在我的旁边,似乎是在等我点餐", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202715_366_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "我迅速浏览了一遍菜单,选了几个看起来还不错的菜", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202715_366_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "他们的旁边都有一个大大的红色大拇指,写着\"店长推荐\"", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202715_366_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "对了,必须得来点小酒", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202715_366_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "roleId": "role3", "text": "今天应该性情一下了", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202715_366_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "（我点了单）" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "这里真是好温暖啊,相比外边,简直是天堂" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "这时我注意到店内其实只有两桌人", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202710_363_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "另一桌似乎只有一个人", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202710_363_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "那位大哥身着朴素,看起来和我年龄相仿", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202710_363_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "过了一阵子,我们的菜上来了" },
    { "roleId": "role3", "text": "老吕啊,今天咱俩必须好好喝点！", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202710_363_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "sound": "audio/yeah.mp3" },
    { "bgm": "audio/audio3.mp3" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "我拿起瓶起子,十分潇洒地起了瓶盖" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "准备倒酒时,发现瓶盖不知去向了" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "算了,这个不重要" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "就在这是,我听到了一声大喊......" },
    { "roleId": "role4", "text": "哥们你挺der啊！！", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202705_358_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "roleId": "role4", "text": "这饭店就你自己吃饭啊？！", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202705_358_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "我转过头,发现隔壁桌的大哥怒目圆睁,死死盯着我的眼睛", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202705_358_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "我测,瓶盖崩他身上了", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202705_358_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "慌乱中我赶紧站起身", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202705_358_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "roleId": "role3", "text": "哎妈兄弟,实在不好意思", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202705_358_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "我能感觉到我的脸在烧", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202705_358_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "roleId": "role3", "text": "这样,我叫服务员给你换一桌", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202705_358_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "roleId": "role3", "text": "服务员----", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202705_358_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "我被他打断了", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202705_358_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "roleId": "role4", "text": "欸,都叫兄弟了那还说啥了", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202708_361_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "roleId": "role4", "text": "我把自己挖出来不就完了", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202708_361_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "roleId": "role4", "text": "行了,回去吃饭吧,别影响心情奥", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202708_361_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "我去,吓死我了" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "不过他人真好啊......" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "......" },
    { "roleId": "role3", "text": "现在该窃听风云了", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202712_364_18.png", "imagePosition": "right" },
    { "roleId": "role4", "text": "服务员,你这里有烟吗", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202715_366_18.png", "imagePosition": "right" },
    { "roleId": "role2", "text": "没有,哥", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202715_366_18.png", "imagePosition": "right" },
    { "roleId": "role4", "text": "你给我买一盒呗", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202715_366_18.png", "imagePosition": "right" },
    { "roleId": "role2", "text": "我店里太忙,走不开哥", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202715_366_18.png", "imagePosition": "right" },
    { "roleId": "role4", "text": "那好吧", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202715_366_18.png", "imagePosition": "right" },
    { "roleId": "role3", "text": "老吕,你去后备箱拿两盒烟过来", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202715_366_18.png", "imagePosition": "right" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "老吕去拿了烟" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "......" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "他把烟递给了我" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "我一定要好好表达我的歉意口牙！！" },
    { "roleId": "role3", "text": "哎兄弟,我后备箱正好有烟,你拿着抽", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202710_363_18.png", "imagePosition": "left" },
    { "roleId": "role4", "text": "你这太性情了哥们", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202710_363_18.png", "imagePosition": "left" },
    { "roleId": "role3", "text": "哎刚才瓶盖崩你脑门上了,哎,我太不好意思", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202710_363_18.png", "imagePosition": "left" },
    { "roleId": "role4", "text": "哎", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202713_365_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "roleId": "role3", "text": "咱都老爷们没那么多事,你拿着抽", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202713_365_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "坐下之后,我和老吕继续吃饭" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "我隐约听见一句\"这扯不扯\"" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "哎,说实话,我好高兴" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "......." },
    { "roleId": "role4", "text": "哎,兄弟", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202713_365_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "roleId": "role4", "text": "我吃完了,先走了奥", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202713_365_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "他拍了拍我送的烟盒,对我笑了笑", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202713_365_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "过了一段时间......" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "该结账了,虽然外边很冷" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "但是我早晚要面对啊" },
    { "roleId": "role3", "text": "服务员,买单", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202715_366_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "roleId": "role2", "text": "已经买过了哥", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202715_366_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "roleId": "role3", "text": "买过了？？老吕你买的？", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202715_366_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "roleId": "role5", "text": "没啊", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202715_366_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "roleId": "role3", "text": "那是谁买的？？", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202715_366_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "roleId": "role2", "text": "后面那桌给你结的", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202715_366_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "roleId": "role3", "text": "哎我,你说这扯不扯", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904202715_366_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "stopBgm": true },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "我匆忙向外跑,只为寻到他的身影" },
    { "background": "images/bg3.png" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "......" },
    { "background": "images/bg1.jpg" },
    { "roleId": "role3", "text": "兄弟！！！", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904203856_367_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "提着昨日种种千辛万苦......", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904203856_367_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "向明天换一些美满和幸福", "image": "images/微信图片_20250904203857_368_18.png", "imagePosition": "center" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "貂蝉在一起了。" },
    { "narrator": true, "text": "END" }
  ]
}